	(text "Here, we measure the current and the voltage of the main voltage \nand voltage of the high_current power source. \n\nThe current is measured with the current-sense amplifier\nThe voltage is measured with a voltage divider. \nFor this, the following formula applies: \nmeasuring_voltage = (bottom resistor) / (Top resistor + Bottom Resistor) * input voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 117.856 146.558 0)
		(effects
