	(text "Additionally, we have a connector for high_current. \nThis power source powers the recovery outputs and can be up to about 33V\nAs a fallback, we can power the FC from this power source. \n\nThere is a second high power input which enables us to use different voltage\nlevels for diffferent outputs"
