	(text "The Vehicle bus connects the FC to the rest of the rocket.\nThis is the main communication and power connection. \n\nIt features: \n- charging voltage: not used on the FC but to charge other \n   boards in the rocket\n- main voltage: up to 12.6V from the main battery supply\n- CAN1 and CAN2 are the CAN-Buses. One for critical\n   communication and one for the rest"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 75.184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
